1
00:03:53,333 --> 00:03:59,333
Sit, stay, save the world.

2
00:07:46,666 --> 00:07:52,666
DC League of Super-Pets is a family, comedy,
adventure film directed by Jared Stern.

3
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:46,000
When Superman and the rest of the Justice League are kidnapped, Krypto the Super-Dog must convince a rag-tag shelter pack - Ace the hound, PB the
potbellied pig, Merton the turtle and Chip the squirrel - to master their own newfound powers and help him rescue the superheroes.

4
00:15:33,333 --> 00:15:39,333
Krypto the Superdog / Anubis / Black Adam (voice), played by Dwayne Johnson.

5
00:19:26,666 --> 00:19:32,666
Ace the Bat-Hound (voice), played by Kevin Hart.

6
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:26,000
Clark Kent / Superman (voice), played by John Krasinski.

7
00:27:13,333 --> 00:27:19,333
Bruce Wayne / Batman (voice), played by Keanu Reeves.

8
00:31:06,666 --> 00:31:12,666
Lulu (voice), played by Kate McKinnon.

9
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
PB (voice), played by Vanessa Bayer.

10
00:38:53,333 --> 00:38:59,333
DC League of Super-Pets is a 2022 American animated
superhero film based on DC Comics characters.

11
00:42:46,666 --> 00:42:52,666
It was directed by Jared Stern, who co-wrote it with John Whittington.

12
00:46:40,000 --> 00:46:46,000
Dwayne Johnson stars as the voice of Krypto, alongside a supporting ensemble voice cast that includes Kevin Hart, Kate McKinnon, John
Krasinski, Vanessa Bayer, Natasha Lyonne, Diego Luna, Marc Maron, Thomas Middleditch, Ben Schwartz, and Keanu Reeves.

13
00:50:33,333 --> 00:50:39,333
It tells the story of Superman's pet dog Krypto and shelter dog Ace who work with
other animals to save captured superheroes from Lex Luthor and Lulu.

14
00:54:26,666 --> 00:54:32,666
During the early days of Warner Animation Group, Stern pitched the film in 2012, after working in an animal shelter, where he
noticed how older animals were less likely to be adopted and wondered about the idea of those pets having superpowers.

15
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:26,000
He was hired to write and direct a film about DC's
Legion of Super-Pets in July 2018.

16
01:02:13,333 --> 01:02:19,333
Levine and Patricia Hicks joined the project in January 2019
as co-director and producer, respectively.

17
01:06:06,666 --> 01:06:12,666
Johnson was signed on to voice Krypto in May 2021, while other main cast members were confirmed to join the voice
roles by June 2021, including Hart, McKinnon, Krasinski, Bayer, Lyonne, Luna, Maron, and Reeves.

18
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The inspiration for the film's animation style came from
Art Deco architecture and illustrator J.C.

19
01:13:53,333 --> 01:13:59,333
Leyendecker.

20
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
The animation was provided by Animal Logic.

21
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
DC League of Super-Pets premiered at the AMC The Grove in Los Angeles, California
on July 13, 2022, and was released in the United States on July 29.

22
01:25:33,333 --> 01:25:39,333
The film received generally positive reviews from critics and grossed
over $207 million worldwide on a $90 million budget.

23
01:29:26,666 --> 01:29:32,666
DC League of Super-Pets was the last film to be produced and released by Warner
Animation Group before the animation studio label folded into Warner Bros.

24
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
Pictures Animation in 2023.

25
01:37:13,333 --> 01:37:19,333
The film explores themes of superhero, villain,
based on comic, dog, super power.

26
01:41:06,666 --> 01:41:12,666
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
